The interfaces IUnitOfWorkManager, IConnectionStringResolver, ICancellationTokenProvider, ICurrentTenant, IMongoDbContextTypeProvider, and IAbpMongoClientFactory are not found in the expected paths. However, I have the IAbpMongoDbContext interface which is the constraint for the generic parameter TMongoDbContext.

I will create a minimal fake implementation of IAbpMongoDbContext for testing and mock the dependencies with Moq. I will also mock the UnitOfWorkManager.Current to return a fake unit of work that supports the GetOrAddDatabaseApi method.

I will write a test that enables the obsolete warning flags and verifies that Logger.LogWarning is called twice, including the call on line 59 with the truncated stack trace.

I will submit the test now. If there are missing references or compile errors, I will adjust accordingly.

